BT 1 0 0 1 0 97.5 Tm /F3 11 Tf 15.5 TL 1.150508 Tw (Pakistan now has three licensed banks clearing Chinese Yuan, a standing swap line with) Tj T* 0 Tw .9726 Tw (Beijing, and its first sovereign Panda Bond. Most coverage of this treats it as a chapter in) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.138309 Tw (de-dollarization, a geopolitical story about currencies competing with the dollar. That framing) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.400383 Tw (answers nothing for a Chinese manufacturer actually deciding how to invoice a Pakistani) Tj T* 0 Tw .917173 Tw (buyer or fund a local subsidiary. This insight sets that framing aside and asks a narrower,) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.107886 Tw (more practical question: which banks actually clear RMB in Pakistan today, what does a firm) Tj T* 0 Tw (concretely save by using them, and where does the settlement system still run dry.) Tj T* ET
Q
