.066667 .066667 .066667 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 149 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 2.594967 Tw (The immediate, practical benefit of this infrastructure is straightforward to price. Under the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.106717 Tw (traditional route, a Pakistani importer buying Chinese machinery had to convert rupees into) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.804257 Tw (dollars and then dollars into RMB, absorbing two separate rounds of bank charges and two) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.425967 Tw (separate windows of exchange rate exposure. Direct RMB settlement through ICBC, Bank of) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.540008 Tw (China, or Standard Chartered removes one leg of that conversion entirely: a Pakistani buyer) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.206467 Tw (purchasing industrial equipment worth Rs50 million from a Chinese supplier can now settle) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.359084 Tw (directly in Yuan, cutting out the dollar intermediation step, reducing bank charges, and giving) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.720757 Tw (both sides more certainty over the final settled amount rather than exposure to a second) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.139673 Tw (currency movement during the transaction window. Industry practitioners in Karachi describe this) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.536777 Tw (as a genuine, quantifiable saving rather than a theoretical one, and are actively encouraging) Tj T* 0 Tw (Pakistani counterparties to invoice in RMB rather than treating it as a slow or passive trend.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 74.0315 382.3504 cm
q
.066667 .066667 .066667 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 163.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 4.831467 Tw (The more important finding for a Chinese investor, however, is structural rather than) Tj T* 0 Tw .732315 Tw (transactional, and it is where nearly all of the de-dollarization coverage stops looking. Pakistan) Tj T* 0 Tw .157944 Tw (runs a large and persistent bilateral trade deficit with China, importing far more than it exports; a) Tj T* 0 Tw .113467 Tw (Carnegie Endowment analysis of the bilateral currency relationship found that this deficit directly) Tj T* 0 Tw .795967 Tw (limits how much RMB the Pakistani banking system can accumulate organically through trade,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.111673 Tw (since exporters simply do not earn enough Yuan to match what importers need to pay out) Tj T* 0 Tw .862955 Tw (\(carnegieendowment.org\). The same analysis identified three concrete, persistent gaps behind) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.004827 Tw (the clearing infrastructure's marketing: low awareness of cross border RMB operations among) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.404191 Tw (Pakistani firms, the continued absence of standard RMB denominated export credit, import) Tj T* 0 Tw .170573 Tw (credit, project financing, and short term working capital loans as products a firm can simply walk) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.805757 Tw (into a bank and request, and a clearing process that remains relatively complex in practice,) Tj T* 0 Tw (which discourages exactly the mid sized firms this infrastructure is meant to serve.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 74.0315 228.3504 cm
q
.066667 .066667 .066667 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 134.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 2.721507 Tw (Read together, the clearing licences and the swap line are two different layers doing two) Tj T* 0 Tw .037257 Tw (different jobs, and the distinction matters for a Chinese firm's planning. The clearing licences are) Tj T* 0 Tw .630444 Tw (commercial bank plumbing: they let a transaction be settled in Yuan on a given day. The swap) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.577757 Tw (line is a sovereign backstop between two central banks, designed to top up Pakistan's RMB) Tj T* 0 Tw .750873 Tw (liquidity when the trade driven pool runs short, not a product any individual company can draw) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.141641 Tw (on directly. Pakistan's own request to raise that backstop from RMB 30 billion to 40 billion, on the) Tj T* 0 Tw .863969 Tw (stated grounds that the existing facility had been exhausted, is the clearest available evidence) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.037007 Tw (that the organic, trade based pool of RMB liquidity in Pakistan's banking system remains thin,) Tj T* 0 Tw .354967 Tw (and that the settlement system currently depends on periodic central bank replenishment rather) Tj T* 0 Tw (than a genuinely self sustaining local Yuan market.) Tj T* ET
