BT 1 0 0 1 0 163.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 1.431507 Tw (For a mid sized Chinese manufacturer, the practical implication is that the existence of three) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.177873 Tw (licensed clearing banks should not be read as evidence of deep, on demand RMB liquidity in) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.376092 Tw (Pakistan. Settling an individual invoice in Yuan is now genuinely straightforward and cheaper) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.083463 Tw (than routing through the dollar. Financing that invoice, however, through RMB denominated) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.085356 Tw (trade credit, a Yuan letter of credit facility, or a short term working capital loan in RMB, remains a) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.162131 Tw (request a firm has to actively negotiate with its bank rather than a standard product it can) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.597257 Tw (assume is on the shelf, and the underlying liquidity behind any such facility ultimately traces) Tj T* 0 Tw .682874 Tw (back to a swap line that Pakistan has already had to ask China to enlarge once. In a period of) Tj T* 0 Tw .374508 Tw (renewed foreign exchange stress in Pakistan, a Chinese firm relying on RMB settlement should) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.098507 Tw (not assume that access will be immune to the same liquidity pressures that periodically affect) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.560854 Tw (dollar denominated transactions, since the swap line that underwrites it is itself a finite,) Tj T* 0 Tw (renegotiable facility rather than a permanent feature of the system.) Tj T* ET
Q
